General requirements
  Operating System (Windows, MacOS, Linux)
    Windows 11
    MacOS verion 13.5 and higher (Apple Silicon required)
    Linux Ubuntu 24.04 and higher (or equivalent version of Fedora, Arch, etc.)
  Pre-built Agent framework (OpenClaw, Hermes, etc.)
  Messaging account and Bot account (Telegram, Whatsapp, etc.)

If using an Online Model
  16GB RAM, 120GB free disk space
  GPU not required but recommended
  Cloud model account with API Key

For an Offline Model (personally recommend Gemma 4 E4B)*
  Multi-Core CPU and GPU with minimum of 8GB VRAM
  Recommend 24GB RAM (36GB recommended) and 16GB VRAM or unified memory of 36GB or more
  200GB free disk space, 1TB recommended
  Local server (example LMStudio) - Local model (recommend not larger than 8GB memory requirement unless large VRAM system)
